OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmostly dying out this evening,
OL,7,Falthough a few continuing overnight
OL,8,Facross the west. Otherwise a dry night
OL,9,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,10,Fclear periods.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMainly dry but rather cloudy
OL,13,Fin the morning with just a few light
OL,14,Fshowers, these mainly across Argyll.
OL,15,FBecoming dry in the afternoon with
OL,16,Fprolonged sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
